#~ msgid "Angelo 1.0.8 adds Select Through: box, lasso and circle selection reach elements hidden behind others while the view stays solid, as in 3ds Max, Maya and Houdini."
#~ msgstr "Angelo 1.0.8 では透過選択が加わりました。ボックス選択、投げ縄選択、サークル選択で、表示をソリッドのまま他の要素の背後に隠れた要素も選択できます。3ds Max、Maya、Houdini と同じです。"

#~ msgid "Angelo 1.0.9 brings your scene's look to the web: the web export and Live Web Preview carry its tone mapping, exposure and World, and Compare with Angelo lays the browser's picture beside Angelo's viewport."
